flowchart TD
    U[User query] --> C[Coordinator node]
    C --> R[Research Agent node]
    R -->|research_results| A[Analyzer node]
    A -->|analysis| W[Writer node]
    W -->|draft| K[Critic node]
    K -->|approved| F[Finalize]
    K -->|issues and retry available| V[Coordinator revision node]
    V -->|revision note| W
    K -->|retry limit reached| F
    R -->|error| F
    A -->|error| F
    W -->|error| F
    K -->|error| F
    F --> O[Final answer and communication log]
